## 7. Datenfluss (Soll)

```
PortfolioPage
  ├─ positions (localStorage / positions.ts)
  ├─ policy.benchmark, policy.rfPct
  ├─ historicalPricesByTicker          (Analyse-Cache, unverändert)
  ├─ historicalPricesByTickerLong      (NEU, Fenster-Fetch)
  ├─ attributionOverrides              (NEU, localStorage)
  └─ PortfolioBacktestPanel
        ├─ computePortfolioBacktest(args + overrides)     // ex-post
        ├─ addTickerToManualPortfolio                     // P1 Add
        └─ runPortfolioMonteCarlo / comparePortfolioWeightings  // ex-ante
```

Fetch-Regel:

- Preset ≤ Cache-Länge → kein Extra-Call
- Preset > Cache-Länge → `GET` OHLCV für alle offenen Longs + Benchmark, Cache separat
- Fehler / leere Serie → `insufficient_data` + reason, keine Interpolation

